cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite the paper and this software as below."
type: software
title: "Rational quivers: Lean 4 formalization of Rational structures on quivers and a generalization of Gelfand's equivalence"
version: "0.9.0"
date-released: "2026-10-23"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/drjanosch42/rational_quivers"
authors:
  - family-names: Januszewski
    given-names: Fabian
    affiliation: "Paderborn University"
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - mathlib
  - formalization
  - quiver representations
  - Harish-Chandra modules
  - Galois descent
  - Gelfand's equivalence
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 and mathlib formalization of the manuscript "Rational structures on quivers and a
  generalization of Gelfand's equivalence": for every field E of characteristic 0 and every
  l >= 0, the functor E_E is an equivalence of abelian categories between the category of
  E-rational Harish-Chandra modules HC_lambda(sl_2, SO(2))_E, lambda = l^2, and the nilpotent
  representations of the E-rational Gelfand quiver (Theorem B; Theorem A is the case E = Q),
  together with the twisted forms. The formalization was carried out with the assistance of
  AI agents (Claude Code and Anthropic's Claude models) under the author's direction.
